{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 48, "data": [{"docid2": 2261792, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260721_2261792.htm", "content": "　　7月20日，市委书记李春主持召开市委常委会会议，传达学习习近平总书记近期重要讲话精神和上级有关会议精神，研究部署有关工作。\n　　会议强调，要深入学习贯彻习近平总书记在上海考察时的重要讲话精神，着力推动", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260721_2261792.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.21 10:59:00", "doctitle": "市委常委会召开会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2475402, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260721_2261792.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2238105, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260708_2238105.htm", "content": "　　7月4日，福建翔丰华新能源材料有限公司研发实验室内，技术人员正与厦门凯纳石墨烯技术股份有限公司团队密切协作，围绕新一代高能快充锂电石墨负极材料研发，开展联合攻关。市科技局精准牵线双方，指导协调，最终", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260708_2238105.htm", "docreltime": "2026.07.08 08:42:00", "doctitle": "我市“链式服务”激活民营经济创新力", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2451373, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/t20260708_2238105.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202607/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2231840, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231840.htm", "content": "　　6月24日，在三明市馨艺家居用品有限公司二期生产车间，开料钻孔、喷漆封边、组装质检各工序有序运转，工人们正全力赶制一批发往海外的鞋柜、书桌、卫浴柜等板式收纳家居产品。\n　　“目前公司3条生产线满负荷运转", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231840.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.25 08:55:00", "doctitle": "我市着力激活民营经济发展新动能", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2444589, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/t20260625_2231840.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2198688, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260403_2198688.htm", "content": "　　3月31日，由福建省发改委、省民营经济发展促进中心与市发改委联合举办的《福建省民营经济促进条例》宣贯暨企业人才培训会在三明举行。省人社厅、教育厅及三明市有关单位、省内十余所高校及技工院校代表，以及百余", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260403_2198688.htm", "docreltime": "2026.04.03 08:55:00", "doctitle": "《福建省民营经济促进条例》宣贯暨企业人才培训会在三明举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2408623, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/t20260403_2198688.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202604/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2195851, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260322_2195851.htm", "content": "　　3月18日至20日，我市成功发放首批民营企业再贷款，共计向三明农商行、沙县农商行等10家地方法人金融机构发放再贷款资金2.96亿元，撬动3.35亿元民营企业贷款，其中1.09亿元投向辖内22条县域重点产业链、1235万元支", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260322_2195851.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.22 10:46:00", "doctitle": "我市发放首批民营企业再贷款", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2405392, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260322_2195851.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2192117, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192117.htm", "content": "　　2月27日，兴业银行三明分行联合三明市国有融资担保有限公司，成功落地我市首笔民间投资专项担保绿色贷款，以金融活水浇灌民营经济沃土，为地方实体经济发展注入强劲动能。\n　　此次专项贷款精准服务本地一家国家", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192117.htm", "docreltime": "2026.03.03 08:44:00", "doctitle": "我市首笔民间投资专项担保绿色贷款投放", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2403647, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/t20260303_2192117.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202603/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2190866, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/t20260222_2190866.htm", "content": "\n\n\n2月5日，三明市发展改革工作会议召开。会议坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，全面贯彻落实党的二十大和二十届历次全会精神，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记在福建考察时的重要讲话精神。会议传达了各级经", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/t20260222_2190866.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.05 21:06:00", "doctitle": "三明市发展改革工作会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2403654, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/t20260222_2190866.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "7aeb2b9705c7f4334d1583be472d513c.jpg", "appdocid": 2190866, "appfile": "W020260228330934206533.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZUTl7KDedrVeeQVtAspZig", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202602/W020260228/W020260228330934206533.jpg", "_href": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/W020260228330934206533.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/", "_firstpic": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xxdt/202602/W020260228330934206533.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2178635, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202512/t20251223_2178635.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，尤溪县宏申实业涤纶加弹DTY、经纬编面料生产线项目完成设备安装调试并正式投产，车间内机器轰鸣、工人各司其职，首批产品生产有序推进。这一项目的落地见效，标志着企业成功跻身高端纺织新材料领域，也", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202512/t20251223_2178635.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.23 15:01:00", "doctitle": "跨域合作双突破 点燃招商新引擎——市工信局助力民营企业高质量发展侧记", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2384956, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202512/t20251223_2178635.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202512/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2166012, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/t20251101_2166012.htm", "content": "\n　　10月31日，在第五个“三明市企业家日”到来之际，我市召开“薪火相传·共话发展”新老民营企业家代表座谈会。省政协副主席、省工商联主席王光远，市委书记李春出席并讲话。市委副书记、市长陈岳峰主持。市领导赖", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/t20251101_2166012.htm", "docreltime": "2025.11.01 09:17:00", "doctitle": "三明市“薪火相传·共话发展”新老民营企业家代表座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2369724, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/t20251101_2166012.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202511/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2159514, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250930_2159514.htm", "content": "\n　　9月28日，福建省工商联发布的2025福建省民营企业百强榜单新鲜出炉，包括2025福建省民营企业100强、制造业民营企业100强、服务业民营企业100强、创新型民营企业100强4个榜单，我市4家企业上榜。\n　　其中，福建金", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250930_2159514.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.30 08:39:00", "doctitle": "我市4家企业入选福建省民营企业百强榜单", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2365024, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250930_2159514.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2154769, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250913_2154769.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，我市印发《关于聚焦提升企业感受 持续优化营商环境的通知》（以下简称《通知》），从对标标杆创建、提升政务服务、强化要素供给等六大维度推出系列改革举措，切实为企业解难题、减负担、强保障，助力全市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250913_2154769.htm", "docreltime": "2025.09.13 19:19:00", "doctitle": "我市出台《关于聚焦提升企业感受持续优化营商环境的通知》", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2364396, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/t20250913_2154769.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202509/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2145393, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250809_2145393.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，全市6个县（市、区）的22家民营企业迎来了一批特殊“访客”——来自三明学院、三明医学科技职业学院等高校的240余名师生，正在参加市人社局联合市委组织部、团市委、市妇联开展的“千名高校毕业生三明行", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250809_2145393.htm", "docreltime": "2025.08.09 11:06:00", "doctitle": "我市高校毕业生毕业去向落实率超九成", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2345465, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/t20250809_2145393.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202508/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2140595, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/t20250723_2140595.htm", "content": "\n　　为更好地推动落实《民营经济促进法》，让每一家民营企业都能从中受益、健康发展，市发改委、市司法局对近年来中央、省、市支持民营经济发展的政策进行梳理，编印《三明市贯彻民营经济促进法 服务民营经济指南（", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/t20250723_2140595.htm", "docreltime": "2025.07.23 15:59:00", "doctitle": "《三明市贯彻民营经济促进法服务民营经济指南（2025）》正式发布", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2403653, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/t20250723_2140595.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "三明市贯彻民营经济促进法服务民营经济指南.pdf", "appdocid": 2140595, "appfile": "P020250723582290114451.pdf", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/t20250723_2140595.htm", "fileext": "pdf", "_src": "/protect/P0202507/P020250723/P020250723582290114451.pdf", "_href": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/P020250723582290114451.pdf"}], "_docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202507/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2132820, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250623_2132820.htm", "content": "\n　　6月13日，三明市市场监管局邀请“省知识产权服务万里行”专家团队深入沙县区机电、化工和新材料等民营企业“把脉问诊”，为企业提升知识产权管理水平提供定制化方案。\n　　这是市市场监管部门持续加大民营经济支", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250623_2132820.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.23 08:53:00", "doctitle": "以市场监管“工具箱”赋能民营经济高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2330786, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250623_2132820.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2131187, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250616_2131187.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，位于三元区莘口镇的福建三农新材料有限责任公司氟精细化学品二期技改项目现场，工人们正紧锣密鼓地生产中。该项目投资1.05亿元，依托原有厂区空间，对生产车间及配套设施进行系统性改造升级，淘汰高能耗", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250616_2131187.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.16 08:52:00", "doctitle": "我市多举措推动民营经济高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2328819, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250616_2131187.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2130730, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250613_2130730.htm", "content": "\n　　6月10日，我市召开全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第二次会议，强调民营经济是三明经济社会高质量发展的关键支撑。\n　　近年来，市委组织部认真贯彻落实市委、市政府关于民营经济发展的工作部署，围绕全", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250613_2130730.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.13 08:52:00", "doctitle": "厚植人才“沃土” 助力民营经济“枝繁叶茂”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2328241, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250613_2130730.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2130084, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130084.htm", "content": "\n　　6月9日，在建宁县同越管件有限公司生产车间，机器轰鸣运转，工人紧张操作，处处呈现出一派繁忙生产景象。公司副总经理李贵林表示，在三明各级党委政府的关心和帮助下，今年企业加大科研投入、做好人才引进，围绕", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130084.htm", "docreltime": "2025.06.11 08:44:00", "doctitle": "我市打好“组合拳” 激发民营经济新活力", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327483, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/t20250611_2130084.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202506/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2123695, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250517_2123695.htm", "content": "\n　　“您好，请问这个岗位对专业技能的具体要求有哪些？”应届大学生林卓穿梭在展位间，手中攥着精心准备的简历，眼神中满是期待。5月16日，由市人社局、市国资委、三明经济开发区管委会、市残联联合主办的2025年三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250517_2123695.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.17 09:02:00", "doctitle": "我市举办“职通未来·才聚三明”民营企业招聘会暨残疾人就业专场活动侧记", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2325987, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250517_2123695.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2121540, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250508_2121540.htm", "content": "\n　　“咱们工人有力量，每天每日工作忙……”5月7日，三明市总工会举办的“百年工运铸辉煌 同心筑梦启新程”全国劳动模范和先进工作者主题宣讲活动，在激昂的舞蹈《咱们工人有力量》中拉开帷幕。来自市直机关事业单", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250508_2121540.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.08 08:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市总工会举办全国劳动模范和先进工作者主题宣讲活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2322199, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/t20250508_2121540.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2118217, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250423_2118217.htm", "content": "\n　　4月21日，市长陈岳峰主持召开市政府常务会议，审议《三明市自然灾害救助应急预案》《关于提增民营小微企业融资服务质效的若干措施》《三明市贯彻落实省统计督察反馈意见整改方案》《三明市矛盾纠纷多元预防化解", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250423_2118217.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.23 08:47:00", "doctitle": "2025年市政府召开第60次常务会议", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2316791, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250423_2118217.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2112882, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250403_2112882.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，市发改委正式发布《三明市民营企业支持政策手册（2025）》（下称《手册》），122条惠企政策通过“线上+线下”的方式被精准推送给企业。\n　　为帮助民营企业家和民营企业及时了解政策信息、充分享受政策优", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250403_2112882.htm", "docreltime": "2025.04.03 08:41:00", "doctitle": "我市发布新版民营企业支持政策手册", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2307868, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/t20250403_2112882.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202504/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2105991, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250311_2105991.htm", "content": "\n　　3月10日，我市召开“把握时与势，创新赢未来”民营企业家代表座谈会，传达学习习近平总书记在民营企业座谈会上的重要讲话精神，通报三明市2024年民营经济工作发展情况，解读相关文件精神。市委常委、统战部部长", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250311_2105991.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.11 08:50:00", "doctitle": "三明市民营企业家代表座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2299739, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250311_2105991.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2105045, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105045.htm", "content": "\n　　3月4日，我市发布《关于进一步优化营商环境更好服务市场主体的若干措施》（以下简称《措施》），用真情实意打造一流营商环境，加快建设能办事、好办事、办成事的“便利三明”，支持市场主体发展壮大。\n　　《措", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105045.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.06 08:42:00", "doctitle": "我市发布15条举措呵护市场主体", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2298670, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/t20250306_2105045.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2101507, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250220_2101507.htm", "content": "\n　　2月17日，习近平总书记在民营企业座谈会上发表重要讲话，充分肯定民营经济发展取得的重大成就和为国家经济社会发展作出的重要贡献，对当前和今后一个时期促进民营经济健康发展、高质量发展作了全面部署，在我市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250220_2101507.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.20 08:52:00", "doctitle": "习近平总书记在民营企业座谈会上的重要讲话在我市引发热烈反响", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2294550, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250220_2101507.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2098762, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250206_2098762.htm", "content": "\n　　立春过后，万物竞发。2月5日，2025年全市持续深化拓展“三争”行动，深入推动“四领一促”工作会议在市会议中心举行，拉开了新一年奋勇争先求突破的序幕。\n　　全市政企代表齐聚一堂，回顾过去一年发展经验，共", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250206_2098762.htm", "docreltime": "2025.02.06 08:42:00", "doctitle": "凝心聚力启新程 政企同心向未来", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2291407, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/t20250206_2098762.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202502/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2093830, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250111_2093830.htm", "content": "\n　　1月10日，我市召开民营企业家座谈会，听取民营企业家意见建议，政企同心共促民营经济高质量发展。市委书记李春出席会议并讲话，市长陈岳峰主持。市领导黄冠华、杨国昕、郭海阳、钟科、吴健成参加。\n　　李春代表", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250111_2093830.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.11 07:55:00", "doctitle": "全市民营企业家座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2285460, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/t20250111_2093830.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2084416, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241208_2084416.htm", "content": "\n　　12月6日，市委副书记、代市长陈岳峰赴大田县、尤溪县、沙县区，向基层干部群众宣讲习近平总书记在福建考察时的重要讲话精神，并开展调研。\n　　陈岳峰先后深入大田县清航无人机、第二集美学村，尤溪县沈郎油茶、", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241208_2084416.htm", "docreltime": "2024.12.08 11:30:00", "doctitle": "市领导赴大田尤溪沙县宣讲并调研", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2276653, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/t20241208_2084416.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202412/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2078047, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241116_2078047.htm", "content": "\n　　11月15日，三明中院与市工商联在三明市法务区联合举办了三明市“法商益企”行动座谈会。\n　　此次会议旨在持续优化三明市的法治化营商环境，为民营经济的高质量发展提供助力。会上，详细解读了《三明市“法商益", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241116_2078047.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.16 09:10:00", "doctitle": "三明市“法商益企”行动座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2266764, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241116_2078047.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2075034, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241105_2075034.htm", "content": "\n　　10月28日至11月2日，上海市国内合作交流服务中心、三明市发改委在上海交通大学终身教育学院联合举办三明市电子领域民营经济人才专题培训班，三明电子商务发展相关单位骨干、32家电子商务领域民营企业高管共计45", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241105_2075034.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.05 09:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市电子商务领域民营经济人才专题培训班在沪举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2262947, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241105_2075034.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2074525, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241103_2074525.htm", "content": "\n　　11月1日，在三明市第四个“三明市企业家日”来临之际，三明市民营经济综合服务平台在e三明正式上线。\n　　三明市民营经济综合服务平台由市发改委牵头开发，是一款能为全市30余万民营市场主体提供便捷、高效的一", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241103_2074525.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.03 12:57:00", "doctitle": "三明市民营经济综合服务平台正式上线", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2266217, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/t20241103_2074525.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202411/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2072993, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/t20241029_2072993.htm", "content": "\n　　人才聚则事业兴。10月26日至27日，市委人才办、市人社局联合举办三明市民营企业开放日暨“千名高校毕业生三明行”活动，多措并举促进高校毕业生高质量就业。来自厦门大学、福州大学、福建农林大学、三明学院等十", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/t20241029_2072993.htm", "docreltime": "2024.10.29 08:36:00", "doctitle": "我市举办2024年民营企业开放日暨“千名高校毕业生三明行”活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2259135, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/t20241029_2072993.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202410/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2072714, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202410/t20241028_2072714.htm", "content": "\n　　10月26日至27日，清流县开展三明市民营企业开放日暨“千名高校毕业生三明（清流）行”活动，为民营企业搭建了“零距离”引才桥梁。三明学院资源与化工学院和黎明职业大学化工相关专业的40余名学生参加此次活动。", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202410/t20241028_2072714.htm", "docreltime": "2024.10.28 10:46:00", "doctitle": "清流县举办三明市民营企业开放日暨“千名高校毕业生三明（清流）行”活动", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2258709, "sourcename": "福建微清流", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202410/t20241028_2072714.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/ztzl/myjjzhfwpt/gzld/202410/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2071930, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/zxft/detail.htm?id=1241&chnlid=2501", "content": "", "docabstract": "2024年10月24日上午10点市发改委党组成员、副主任邹水星接受三明市政府门户网站专访就“落实新时代民营经济强省战略，推进三明高质量发展”主题与广大市民直接在线交流，倾听群众心声、", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/zxft/detail.htm?id=1241&chnlid=2501", "docreltime": "2024.10.24 10:35:00", "doctitle": "访谈|落实新时代民营经济强省战略，推进三明高质量发展", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2257824, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "https://www.sm.gov.cn/wz/zxft/detail.htm?id=1241&chnlid=2501", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2064999, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/fzggzx/202409/t20240930_2064999.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实党的二十届三中全会精神和省委十一届六次全会精神，认真落实省委、省政府工作要求，深化拓展“深学争优、敢为争先、实干争效”行动，更好服务各地经济社会发展，9月23日至24日，省发改委党组成员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/fzggzx/202409/t20240930_2064999.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.30 08:53:00", "doctitle": "省发改委赴三明市开展2024年三季度调研服务", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2254054, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/fzggzx/202409/t20240930_2064999.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://fgw.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/fzggzx/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2058297, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202409/t20240906_2058297.htm", "content": "\n　　党的二十届三中全会审议通过了《中共中央关于进一步全面深化改革、推进中国式现代化的决定》，是新时代新征程上推动全面深化改革的总动员。省委十一届六次全会深入学习贯彻党的二十届三中全会精神，对新征程上进", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "中共三明市委关于进一步全面深化改革 在推进中国式现代化中 奋力谱写三明革命老区振兴发展时代新篇的决定", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202409/t20240906_2058297.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.06 08:35:00", "doctitle": "中共三明市委关于进一步全面深化改革 在推进中国式现代化中奋力谱写三明革命老区振兴发展时代新篇的决定", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2249029, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "（2024年8月27日中国共产党三明市第十届委员会第七次全体会议通过）", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202409/t20240906_2058297.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2053772, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240826_2053772.htm", "content": "\n　　党的二十届三中全会强调，改革开放只有进行时，没有完成时。全党必须自觉把改革摆在更加突出位置，紧紧围绕推进中国式现代化进一步全面深化改革。\n　　勇当发展排头兵，靠的是改革，推进中国式现代化，靠的也是", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240826_2053772.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.26 08:40:00", "doctitle": "市政协持续推动提案办理工作见实见效", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2239906, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240826_2053772.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2049686, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240809_2049686.htm", "content": "\n　　8月2日，三明市交通运输局率先运用“闽执法”平台牵头联合市应急管理局、市公安局对三明市联华石油运输有限公司开展“综合查一次”执法检查。\n　　齐抓共管，部门联合执法破难题 \n　　三明市交通运输局全面应用", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240809_2049686.htm", "docreltime": "2024.08.09 09:18:00", "doctitle": "三明交通率先运用“闽执法”平台开展“综合查一次”联合执法检查", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2236372, "sourcename": "市交通运输局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/t20240809_2049686.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202408/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2046426, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240727_2046426.htm", "content": "\n　　连日来，我市各级工商联干部、民营经济人士认真学习领悟党的二十届三中全会精神。大家纷纷表示，要牢记嘱托、感恩奋进，做好主业、做强实业，把全会提出的改革发展任务同自身工作结合起来，对标对表、深谋实干，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240727_2046426.htm", "docreltime": "2024.07.27 13:56:00", "doctitle": "我市工商联系统和民营经济人士认真学习贯彻党的二十届三中全会精神", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226084, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/t20240727_2046426.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202407/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2025559, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025559.htm", "content": "\n　　5月7日至11日，上海市国内合作交流服务中心、三明市发展和改革委员会在上海交通大学终身教育学院联合举办三明市生物医药领域民营经济人才专题培训班，三明生物医药特色产业链链长单位骨干、34家生物医药领域民营", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025559.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.13 11:30:00", "doctitle": "三明市生物医药领域民营经济人才专题培训班在沪举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226083, "sourcename": "三明市发改委", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025559.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "240515.png", "appdocid": 2025559, "appfile": "W020240515583852191598.png", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/t20240515_2025559.htm", "fileext": "png", "_src": "/webpic/W0202405/W020240515/W020240515583852191598.png", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/W020240515583852191598.png"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202405/W020240515583852191598.png", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2021365, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021365.htm", "content": "\n　　4月28日，市委书记、市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组组长李兴湖主持召开领导小组第一次会议，听取2023年工作情况汇报，研究2024年工作。市长、市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第一副组长李", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021365.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.29 09:38:00", "doctitle": "三明市全面落实新时代民营经济强省战略领导小组第一次会议召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226082, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021365.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2021361, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021361.htm", "content": "\n　　4月28日，走进位于将乐的福建金牛水泥公司，厂区道路干净整洁，满眼绿意，绿树浓荫。“节后开机以来，窑运转率达到了 98%，一季度销售达到24.5万吨。”将乐金牛水泥生产调度中心主任郑桂华说。\n　　福建金牛水泥", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021361.htm", "docreltime": "2024.04.29 09:37:00", "doctitle": "我市民营经济发展实现新提升", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226081, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/t20240429_2021361.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202404/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1988660, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231227_1988660.htm", "content": "\n　　今年以来，全市政法机关秉持“法治是最好的营商环境”理念，从执法、司法全链条发力，把服务保障民营经济发展作为履行职责与服务大局的结合点、着力点，让法治与营商环境“同频共振”，着力打造良法善治的法治环", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231227_1988660.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.27 08:48:00", "doctitle": "我市政法机关多措并举助推民营经济高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226080, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231227_1988660.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1984841, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231215_1984841.htm", "content": "\n　　一是优化环境。开展提升民营企业金融营商环境专项行动，破解山区民营经济融资难、融资贵等五大痛点，1-10月新增民营企业贷款90.95亿元。 \n　　二是助企服务。通过“一产业一座谈”“一链条一座谈”等方式，提升", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231215_1984841.htm", "docreltime": "2023.12.15 09:27:00", "doctitle": "我市金融助力民营经济企稳回升", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226079, "sourcename": "三明市金融局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/t20231215_1984841.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202312/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1971699, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/t20231103_1971699.htm", "content": "\n　　11月1日，在三明市第三个“三明市企业家日”来临之际， 由市委统战部、市发改委、市工信局、市税务局、市工商联主办的“三明市惠企政策发布会暨明商大讲坛”活动成功举办。\n　　在市区的市工商联（总商会）副会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/t20231103_1971699.htm", "docreltime": "2023.11.03 08:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市支持民营经济做大做优做强近期若干举措发布", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226078, "sourcename": "三明市发展和改革委员会", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/t20231103_1971699.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [{"appdesc": "b40cafd0f1ad46d7b3df06ce90adbb24.jpg", "appdocid": 1971699, "appfile": "W020231103324820078764.jpg", "appflag": 20, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/t20231103_1971699.htm", "fileext": "jpg", "_src": "/webpic/W0202311/W020231103/W020231103324820078764.jpg", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/W020231103324820078764.jpg"}], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/", "_firstpic": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202311/W020231103324820078764.jpg", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1966773, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202310/t20231020_1966773.htm", "content": "\n　　10月16日，在三明市海斯福化工有限公司绿色氟精细化学品项目（二期）的生产车间内，各条产品线正开足马力生产。\n　　海斯福相关负责人介绍：“新项目上线，用电扩容问题成为项目推进的‘拦路虎’。多亏明溪县工", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202310/t20231020_1966773.htm", "docreltime": "2023.10.20 08:42:00", "doctitle": "我市深化主题教育推进民营经济高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226077, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202310/t20231020_1966773.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202310/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1949032, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230921_1949032.htm", "content": "\n　　9月20日，市长李春深入三明高新区，实地察看中机碳素新材料、圆宴调味品生产、未来药业等民营企业和重点项目，并在沙县区主持召开民营企业家座谈会，就扎实开展主题教育，推动落实省委、市委全会精神，促进民营", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230921_1949032.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.21 09:44:00", "doctitle": "市领导调研推动民营经济发展工作", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226076, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230921_1949032.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1943576, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230915_1943576.htm", "content": "\n　　“积极引导鼓励民营企业职工参加劳动和技能竞赛”。市委十届五次全会提出，构建民营经济高质量发展的要素保障体系。9月11日，市总工会结合工会职能和工作实际，制定印发《关于支持民营经济发展的若干措施（暂行", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230915_1943576.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.15 09:17:00", "doctitle": "市总工会出台措施支持民营经济高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226075, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230915_1943576.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1940005, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工作亮点", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230906_1940005.htm", "content": "\n　　9月5日，市委书记李兴湖主持召开全市民营经济发展座谈会，学习贯彻习近平总书记关于民营经济发展的重要论述，传达学习党中央、国务院《关于促进民营经济发展壮大的意见》和省委十一届四次全会精神，听取民营企业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230906_1940005.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.06 09:05:00", "doctitle": "全市民营经济发展座谈会召开", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2226074, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/t20230906_1940005.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zwxx/sjdt/202309/", "rels": []}]}